!!
!! SA-AMG (PRECOND=22) test : mixed shell (761) + solid (361), NDOF=3
!! SA-AMG operates on a uniform 3x3 block (translational DOF); the 761 shell
!! and 361 solid share the same 3-DOF node block.
!! coarsest solver forced to dense LDL^T (coarse_solver=2 (int slot1)) -> no external library dependency.
!!
!SOLUTION, TYPE=STATIC
!BOUNDARY
  FIX, 1, 3, 0.0
!CLOAD
  LOAD, 3, -1.0
!SOLVER, METHOD=CG, PRECOND=22, ITERLOG=NO, TIMELOG=NO
 10000, 1
 1.0e-8, 1.0, 0.0
 2
!WRITE,RESULT
!END
